png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/27/0h0w036t6233vlbu1mmpjh6q07bl5j9.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%87%A3%E6%9C%8D%2C%E6%88%96%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/27/0h0w036t6233vlbu1mmpjh6q07bl5j9.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%87%A3%E6%9C%8D%2C%E6%88%96%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/27/0h0w036t6233vlbu1mmpjh6q07bl5j9.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />臣服,或毁灭\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"能量倾泻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">能量倾泻</font></span></span>]，瞬移至敌人面前，造成（<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>+<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>×✦）物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]。攻击前驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>+✦个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]，施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>+层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">粉碎</font></span></span>]。<br />✦本技能每消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>点✦，对目标额外施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个以下[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×主动技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×主动技</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×被动技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×被动技</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]（晕眩持续1回合，其他效果持续2回合）。<br />✦若击败目标，则返还所消耗的✦。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/54/aepucshqtkja8ptie99s4adb8a6jsog.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/54/aepucshqtkja8ptie99s4adb8a6jsog.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_